AWD3HighThreshold|High Threshold|ADCgroup||=AWD3LowThreshold|4095|Configures the ADC analog watchdog High threshold value.
AWD3LowThreshold|Low Threshold|ADCgroup||0|=AWD3HighThreshold|Configures the ADC analog watchdog Low threshold value.
AWD3ITMode|Interrupt Mode|ADCgroup||||Specifies whether the analog watchdog is configured in interrupt mode or in polling mode.
